{"seq":10,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-mcp-instructions-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/sc-01-inc-tansley-carrier-api/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T07:59:28.722Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"a21506a619ddc04d3c77f9dd16a629a41c069a9c5651d52305c71032b127518f","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C3Q718BAO28","text":"I answered Hollis in a thread on his message in #inc-tansley-carrier-api: the store is **Pine Crossing**.\n\n- **Where it came from:** Pree said it in #central-team on Jun 9, and Hollis is a member of that channel. The morning receiver could only see the afternoon shift on the appointment screen. A driver who arrived at 7:10 ended up logged on a sticky note.\n- **Hollis's follow-up in that thread:** he said he'd check the shift template and ask support to reproduce the problem using the store's login.\n- **What I couldn't find:** there's no separate site code or address for Pine Crossing anywhere I can see, and the shared account folders are empty. I told him that rather than guess.\n\nThe answer has no money figures and nothing from anyone's direct messages, so it was fine to post in that channel."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3Q718BAO28","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
